28.
Post balance sheet events
Since the balance sheet date the following events have occurred:
• H Winks was sold to Leicester;
• P Porro joined from Sporting Lisbon;
• G Vicario joined from Empoli;
• M Solomon joined from Shakhtar;
• D Kulusevski joined from Juventus;
